{"id":40324,"date":"2025-02-08T16:58:02","date_gmt":"2025-02-08T15:58:02","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=40324"},"modified":"2026-08-21T08:55:45","modified_gmt":"2026-08-21T07:55:45","slug":"skyrunning-serra-dos-passos-2025","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/skyrunning-serra-dos-passos-2025\/","title":{"rendered":"Skyrunning Serra dos Passos 2025"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"pr-expired-notice\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15) 0%, rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.6) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.35); border-radius: 16px; padding: 18px 24px; margin-bottom: 24px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex: 1; min-width: 260px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f<\/span><div><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\">Esta edi\u00e7\u00e3o j\u00e1 decorreu.<\/strong><p style=\"font-size: 13.5px; color: #CBD5E1; margin: 2px 0 0 0;\">Consulta os resultados desta prova abaixo ou acede a todos os detalhes da edi\u00e7\u00e3o atual.<\/p><\/div><\/div><a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/skyrunning-serra-dos-passos\/\" style=\"background: #8B5CF6 !important; color: #FFFFFF !important; font-weight: 700 !important; font-size: 13.5px !important; text-decoration: none !important; padding: 11px 22px !important; border-radius: 10px !important; white-space: nowrap !important; display: inline-flex !important; align-items: center !important; justify-content: center !important; height: 42px !important; margin: 0 !important; border: none !important; line-height: 1 !important; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4) !important;\">Ver Edi\u00e7\u00e3o Atual &rarr;<\/a><\/div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">O evento, Skyrace\u00ae Serra dos Passos, realizar-se-\u00e1 no dia 26 de Abril de 2025 na localidade dos Passos, Mirandela. O percurso, criado pela equipa Mirandela a Correr, percorre as belas Serra dos Passos (940m) e Serra de Santa Comba (1002m), donde, podem ser avistadas as magnificas paisagens transmontanas.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br>O evento, \u00e9 coorganizado, pela equipa Mirandela a Correr, sendo articulado com a Federa\u00e7\u00e3o de Campismo e Montanhismo de Portugal (FCMP) e tendo como parceiros a Junta de Freguesia dos Passos e a C\u00e2mara Municipal de Mirandela. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A vertente competitiva, est\u00e1 cons2tu\u00edda por duas provas, Mini Skyrace\u00ae Serra dos Passos 10K e Skyrace\u00ae Serra dos Passos 22 KM (*prova certificada pela Internacional Skyrunning Federa2on (ISF). Tem como diretores t\u00e9cnicos, Helder Silva e Armindo Juvenal, da equipa Mirandela a Correr.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":40325,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[708,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[100,726],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-40324","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-mirandela-braganca","event_type-skyrunning","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-braganca","event_type_2-porto-e-norte"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/679d71006f282_51847156_570955213316190_7867839491623354368_n-1.jpg","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/40324","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/